      "content": "# Parent Content Indicator Component\n\n## Architectural Recommendation\n\nCreate a **prominent, toggle-able banner component** that displays above the message list to indicate parent content connection status. This replaces the small link icon with a clear, scannable indicator that shows:\n1. **Connected state**: Parent context is active (show parent name + clear visual badge)\n2. **Disconnected state**: Parent knowledge/files are ignored (show warning with toggle action)\n\nThis approach provides immediate visual feedback while maintaining the toggle functionality without cluttering the header.\n\n---\n\n## Design System Specification\n\n### Layout & Structure\n| Aspect | Specification |\n|--------|---------------|\n| **Container** | Full-width banner, positioned between header and message list |\n| **Height** | 44px (compact, non-intrusive) |\n| **Spacing** | 8px internal padding, consistent with chat UI |\n| **Grid** | Flexbox row with `items-center justify-between` |\n| **State Transitions** | Smooth collapse/expand (max-height animation, 200ms) |\n\n### Typography\n| Element | Font Stack | Size | Weight | Color |\n|---------|-----------|------|--------|-------|\n| **Parent Name** | System (inherited) | 13px | 500 | `text-base-content/70` |\n| **Status Label** | System (inherited) | 12px | 400 | `text-base-content/50` |\n| **Action Button Text** | System (inherited) | 12px | 500 | Dynamic (info/warning) |\n\n### Color Palette\n| State | Background | Border | Text | Icon |\n|-------|-----------|--------|------|------|\n| **Connected** | `bg-info/5` | `border-info/30` | `text-info` | `fa-link text-info` |\n| **Disconnected** | `bg-warning/5` | `border-warning/30` | `text-warning` | `fa-link-slash text-warning` |\n| **Hover** | `bg-info/10` or `bg-warning/10` | Elevated opacity | Same | Same |\n\n### UX States\n| State | Behavior | Visual Feedback |\n|-------|----------|-----------------|\n| **Default (Connected)** | Shows parent info with quiet styling | Info badge, subtle colors |\n| **Default (Disconnected)** | Shows warning with action prompt | Warning badge, elevated contrast |\n| **Hover** | Background opacity increases, button interactive | Cursor pointer, background lift |\n| **After Toggle** | Animates state change | Smooth transition, optional toast confirmation |\n\n---\n\n## Design Variations\n\n### **Design A: Inline Compact Banner** (Recommended for tight layouts)\n```vue src/components/chat/ParentContentIndicator.vue\n<script setup>\nimport moment from 'moment'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div \n    v-if=\"parentChat\"\n    class=\"w-full shrink-0 transition-all duration-200\"\n    :class=\"[\n      isDisconnected \n        ? 'bg-warning/5 border-l-4 border-warning' \n        : 'bg-info/5 border-l-4 border-info'\n    ]\"\n  >\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 gap-2\">\n      <!-- Left: Parent info -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\">\n        <i \n          :class=\"[\n            'fa-solid text-sm shrink-0',\n            isDisconnected ? 'fa-link-slash text-warning' : 'fa-link text-info'\n          ]\"\n        ></i>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 min-w-0 flex-1\">\n          <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-base-content/70\">\n            Parent: <span class=\"font-semibold truncate\">{{ parentChat.name }}</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-base-content/50\">\n            {{ isDisconnected ? 'Knowledge & files disconnected' : 'Context connected' }}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right: Toggle button -->\n      <button\n        class=\"btn btn-xs btn-ghost shrink-0 transition-colors\"\n        :class=\"isDisconnected ? 'hover:text-warning' : 'hover:text-info'\"\n        @click=\"toggleParentDisconnect\"\n        :title=\"isDisconnected ? 'Reconnect parent context' : 'Disconnect parent context'\"\n      >\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium\">\n          {{ isDisconnected ? 'Reconnect' : 'Disconnect' }}\n        </span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  props: {\n    parentChat: {\n      type: Object,\n      required: true\n    },\n    isDisconnected: {\n      type: Boolean,\n      default: false\n    }\n  },\n  emits: ['toggle-disconnect'],\n  methods: {\n    toggleParentDisconnect() {\n      this.$emit('toggle-disconnect')\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n---\n\n### **Design B: Card-Style Badge** (For visual prominence)\n```vue src/components/chat/ParentContentIndicator.vue\n<script setup>\nimport moment from 'moment'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div \n    v-if=\"parentChat\"\n    class=\"w-full shrink-0 px-2 py-2\"\n  >\n    <div \n      class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border-2 transition-all duration-200\"\n      :class=\"[\n        isDisconnected \n          ? 'bg-warning/10 border-warning/40 hover:border-warning/60' \n          : 'bg-info/10 border-info/40 hover:border-info/60'\n      ]\"\n    >\n      <!-- Left: Status icon + parent info -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\">\n        <div \n          class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full shrink-0\"\n          :class=\"isDisconnected ? 'bg-warning' : 'bg-info'\"\n        ></div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 min-w-0 flex-1\">\n          <div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/80\">\n            {{ isDisconnected ? 'Parent Disconnected' : 'Parent Connected' }}\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-base-content/60 truncate\">\n            {{ parentChat.name }}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right: Action button -->\n      <button\n        class=\"btn btn-xs btn-ghost shrink-0 transition-colors\"\n        :class=\"isDisconnected \n          ? 'text-warning hover:bg-warning/20' \n          : 'text-info hover:bg-info/20'\"\n        @click=\"toggleParentDisconnect\"\n      >\n        <i :class=\"['fa-solid text-xs', isDisconnected ? 'fa-plug' : 'fa-plug-circle-xmark']\"></i>\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium hidden sm:inline\">\n          {{ isDisconnected ? 'Reconnect' : 'Disconnect' }}\n        </span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  props: {\n    parentChat: {\n      type: Object,\n      required: true\n    },\n    isDisconnected: {\n      type: Boolean,\n      default: false\n    }\n  },\n  emits: ['toggle-disconnect'],\n  methods: {\n    toggleParentDisconnect() {\n      this.$emit('toggle-disconnect')\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n---\n\n### **Design C: Minimal Chevron Collapse** (Most compact, expandable)\n```vue src/components/chat/ParentContentIndicator.vue\n<script setup>\nimport moment from 'moment'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div \n    v-if=\"parentChat\"\n    class=\"w-full shrink-0 transition-all duration-200\"\n  >\n    <!-- Collapsed header -->\n    <div\n      class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 cursor-pointer transition-colors\"\n      :class=\"[\n        isExpanded \n          ? (isDisconnected ? 'bg-warning/5' : 'bg-info/5')\n          : 'hover:bg-base-200'\n      ]\"\n      @click=\"isExpanded = !isExpanded\"\n    >\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\">\n        <i \n          :class=\"[\n            'fa-solid text-xs shrink-0 transition-transform',\n            isExpanded ? 'rotate-90' : 'rotate-0',\n            isDisconnected ? 'text-warning fa-chevron-right' : 'text-info fa-chevron-right'\n          ]\"\n        ></i>\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-base-content/60 truncate\">\n          Parent: <span class=\"font-semibold text-base-content/80\">{{ parentChat.name }}</span>\n        </span>\n        <span \n          class=\"badge badge-xs shrink-0\"\n          :class=\"isDisconnected ? 'badge-warning' : 'badge-info'\"\n        >\n          {{ isDisconnected ? 'Disconnected' : 'Connected' }}\n        </span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Expanded details -->\n    <div\n      v-if=\"isExpanded\"\n      class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-base-200/30 border-t border-base-300 animate-in fade-in duration-150\"\n    >\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-base-content/70\">\n          {{ isDisconnected \n            ? 'This chat is isolated from parent knowledge and files.' \n            : 'This chat inherits knowledge and files from parent context.' }}\n        </p>\n        <button\n          class=\"btn btn-xs w-full transition-colors\"\n          :class=\"isDisconnected \n            ? 'btn-info btn-outline' \n            : 'btn-warning btn-outline'\"\n          @click=\"toggleParentDisconnect\"\n        >\n          <i :class=\"['fa-solid', isDisconnected ? 'fa-link' : 'fa-link-slash']\"></i>\n          {{ isDisconnected ? 'Reconnect Parent' : 'Disconnect Parent' }}\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  props: {\n    parentChat: {\n      type: Object,\n      required: true\n    },\n    isDisconnected: {\n      type: Boolean,\n      default: false\n    }\n  },\n  emits: ['toggle-disconnect'],\n  data() {\n    return {\n      isExpanded: false\n    }\n  },\n  methods: {\n    toggleParentDisconnect() {\n      this.$emit('toggle-disconnect')\n      this.isExpanded = false\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration into ChatView.vue\n\nReplace the small button in the header with the component placeholder, then render the indicator above the message list:\n\n```vue src/views/ChatView.vue\n<!-- In HEADER section: Replace this -->\n<button \n  v-if=\"workingChat.parent_id\"\n  class=\"btn btn-sm tooltip\" \n  data-tip=\"Disconnect from parent knowledge & files\"\n  @click=\"toggleParentDisconnect\"\n  :class=\"isDisconnectedFromParent ? 'btn-ghost text-gray-500' : 'btn-ghost text-info'\"\n>\n  <i class=\"fa-solid fa-link\"></i>\n</button>\n\n<!-- With this (compact header): -->\n<!-- (Remove the button entirely) -->\n\n<!-- Then in CONTENT section, BEFORE Chat component: -->\n<ParentContentIndicator\n  v-if=\"parentChat\"\n  :parentChat=\"parentChat\"\n  :isDisconnected=\"isDisconnectedFromParent\"\n  @toggle-disconnect=\"toggleParentDisconnect\"\n/>\n\n<!-- Then render Chat as normal -->\n<Chat \n  v-else\n  :chat=\"workingChat\" \n  :showHidden=\"showHidden\" \n  ...\n/>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n1. **Do NOT use low-contrast grays on disconnected state** \u2014 The warning color must remain scannable. Avoid `text-base-content/40` for critical status labels.\n\n2. **Do NOT hide the parent name in collapsed states** \u2014 Always show `parentChat.name` at minimum, even when compact. Users need instant context recall.\n\n3. **Do NOT use toggle-only interactions without confirmation** \u2014 Provide clear visual feedback (e.g., toast notification or state animation) after toggle to prevent accidental disconnects.\n\n---\n\n## Step-by-Step Implementation\n\n1. **Choose your design variant** (A=modern/balanced, B=prominent/visual, C=minimal/expandable)\n2. **Create the component file** at `src/components/chat/ParentContentIndicator.vue`\n3. **Import in ChatView.vue** at the top of the file\n4. **Remove the old link icon button** from the header\n5. **Add the indicator component** between header and message list (or use inside Chat if preferred)\n6. **Test all states**: Connected, Disconnected, Hover, Toggle animation\n7. **Add optional toast feedback** on toggle for user confirmation\n\nWhich design resonates most with your product's aesthetic?",
